From 53e2aaedb148b2e6517d00478d6178a1bba25288 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Feb 2026 23:46:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: use GitHub Actions secrets for all provider API keys

- Remove .env.example; API keys come from GitHub repository secrets
- Add missing secrets to all workflows (Vultr, UpCloud, Scaleway were
  not being passed through)
- Update check:providers script to reference env vars, not .env files

Required GitHub secrets to configure:
  DIGITALOCEAN_API_KEY, HETZNER_API_KEY, VULTR_API_KEY,
  UPCLOUD_USERNAME, UPCLOUD_PASSWORD, SCALEWAY_API_KEY

https://claude.ai/code/session_0156dpRadn5qty4vKdAZF6A7
---
 .env.example                          | 54 ---------------------------
 .github/workflows/ci.yml              |  6 ++-
 .github/workflows/deploy.yml          |  4 ++
 .github/workflows/scheduled-tests.yml |  4 ++
 scripts/check-providers.ts            | 38 ++++---------------
 5 files changed, 20 insertions(+), 86 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 .env.example

diff --git a/.env.example b/.env.example
deleted file mode 100644
index d98de10..0000000
--- a/.env.example
+++ /dev/null
@@ -1,54 +0,0 @@
-# VPS Compare - Provider API Keys
-#
-# Copy this file to .env and fill in your API keys:
-#   cp .env.example .env
-#
-# Then verify connectivity:
-#   npm run check:providers
-#
-# Providers without valid keys will be silently skipped during build.
-# Linode works without any API key.
-
-# ────────────────────────────────────────
-# Linode (no API key required)
-# Public endpoints, works out of the box.
-# ────────────────────────────────────────
-
-# ────────────────────────────────────────
-# DigitalOcean
-# Get a read-only personal access token:
-# https://cloud.digitalocean.com/account/api/tokens
-# ────────────────────────────────────────
-DIGITALOCEAN_API_KEY=
-
-# ────────────────────────────────────────
-# Hetzner Cloud
-# Create an API token (read-only) in any project:
-# https://console.hetzner.cloud/ → Select project → Security → API Tokens
-# ────────────────────────────────────────
-HETZNER_API_KEY=
-
-# Include ARM-based servers (default: false)
-HETZNER_INCLUDE_ARM=false
-
-# ────────────────────────────────────────
-# Vultr
-# Create an API key (enable only "subscriptions" scope for read-only):
-# https://my.vultr.com/settings/#settingsapi
-# ────────────────────────────────────────
-VULTR_API_KEY=
-
-# ────────────────────────────────────────
-# UpCloud
-# Create a sub-account with API access:
-# https://hub.upcloud.com/account → Sub-accounts
-# ────────────────────────────────────────
-UPCLOUD_USERNAME=
-UPCLOUD_PASSWORD=
-
-# ────────────────────────────────────────
-# Scaleway
-# Generate an API key (secret key):
-# https://console.scaleway.com/project/credentials
-# ────────────────────────────────────────
-SCALEWAY_API_KEY=
